 ledger. A plant OPERATIONS COORDINATION actor for PRIMARY smelting and
 refining of precious and other non-ferrous metals (gold/silver/copper/
 aluminum smelting-refining lines: ore/concentrate/scrap -> smelting
 furnace -> refining stage (electrolytic refining cell / anode furnace
 / converter) -> doré bar/bullion bar/cathode/anode/ingot) -- not
 direct smelting/refining-furnace-equipment control authority. Four ops
 (`:log-production-batch` / `:schedule-maintenance` /
 `:flag-safety-concern` / `:coordinate-shipment`), all `:effect
