 registration before maintenance scheduling, independent batch
 verification/registration before shipment coordination, independent
 shipment-weight recompute against the batch's own logged weight,
 double-schedule guard, purity-grade validation, and impurity-rate
 plausibility validation. Safety-concern flagging (molten-metal-hazard/
